{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"fe7fb45a933ead2541b25f4d9c5dbba806c8cf50f37b194664707c84b924c0d3","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_360403a39a5a236892733b67b1db942db29f1e9387b66b42a662b9e561719965","overall_assessment":"The paper provides specific details regarding data licensing (Creative Commons) and software licensing (BSD), which are positive compliance indicators. However, the supplied evidence is insufficient to determine broader policy compliance, anonymity status, or plagiarism, as no frozen venue policies or external overlap evidence are available.","paper_id":"rJiNwv9gg","paper_identity_sha256":"7e8293881de5b26cc2bf5d787f9ca249c7eb8c348a5df1a670e7f65a4a019dbe","prompt_identity_sha256":"090f456c99c763a70c5930dda9f85559b16f003d4c730cbd7035236d83f1e195","raw_response_sha256":"be3c6f7fc443e4821bf3ee6646c085a9eebf791c3b59bd9560a0d696a84af3ef","request_identity_sha256":"eb01e4cb811aa6d8d72f8b5d1d94369ce7c7a429791e65cb48d4c1563e4bc1e9","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"466dd3270ba826ae1c9b759fff82ec5603c1ea29d999cd6c563e75ef79f7b897","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-030"],"review_text":"The paper describes a Mean Opinion Score (MOS) test involving 24 non-expert evaluators. The text details the procedure, including the use of a calibration image and the rating scale, but does not explicitly state whether ethical review board (IRB) approval was obtained or if informed consent was secured from the participants. While the study involves human subjects, the absence of a specific ethics statement in the provided text limits the ability to verify full compliance with human-subjects research standards.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-021","SRC-023"],"review_text":"The authors state that the training data consists of 434 high-quality images licensed under Creative Commons and obtained from Flickr. This explicit mention of the license type is a strength regarding data usage compliance. Additionally, the paper notes the use of a publicly available BSD-licensed implementation for the range coder, which clarifies the software licensing terms. The use of the Kodak PhotoCD dataset for testing is standard in the field, and no privacy violations or misuse of restricted data are indicated in the text.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper header explicitly lists the authors' names (Lucas Theis, Wenzhe Shi, Andrew Cunningham, Ferenc Huszar), their affiliation (Twitter Cortex, London, UK), and their email addresses. While these details are visible in the provided text, the corpus build does not include a frozen venue or year-specific anonymity policy. Therefore, it is not possible to determine whether this disclosure constitutes a violation of double-blind review policies or if the submission was intended for a non-anonymous venue.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The supplied evidence does not contain information regarding textual overlap, figure reuse, or parallel submissions to other venues. The paper cites relevant prior work (e.g., Balle et al., 2016; Toderici et al., 2016a), which suggests proper attribution of ideas. However, without access to external plagiarism databases or a frozen record of other submissions, the supplied paper-only evidence is insufficient to confirm originality or rule out dual submission.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-021","SRC-023"],"review_text":"The paper includes specific compliance documentation within the text, such as the Creative Commons license for the training data and the BSD license for the range coder implementation. These explicit license identifiers are a strength for policy compliance. However, the paper does not contain a dedicated 'Broader Impact' statement or a completed ethics checklist. As no frozen policy obligation requiring such a statement is provided in the evidence, the absence of a broader impact section cannot be declared a violation, but the specific data and software licensing disclosures are noted as positive compliance evidence.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"ef0ec7ebf20f2359b6ddbea6aeaf8d201c41cfff156f5c757442809c6912f23d","paper_id":"rJiNwv9gg","paper_ordinal":96,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"be3c6f7fc443e4821bf3ee6646c085a9eebf791c3b59bd9560a0d696a84af3ef","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"rJiNwv9gg","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"7ab0849883225bd5a80848a9e098cf9a67f7dedc5e06651886f831d30ae7b158","request_identity_sha256":"eb01e4cb811aa6d8d72f8b5d1d94369ce7c7a429791e65cb48d4c1563e4bc1e9","role":"POL","schema_version":"no-memory-full-review-corpus-build-v5","usage":{"completion_tokens":832,"prompt_tokens":19705,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"total_tokens":20537},"valid":true}],"request_identity_sha256":"eb01e4cb811aa6d8d72f8b5d1d94369ce7c7a429791e65cb48d4c1563e4bc1e9","role":"POL","role_ordinal":4,"schema_version":"corpus-build-bootstrap-checkpoint-v4"}